rts streamer, cheerleader, and flight attendant, each with their own unique charm, adding a layer of romance to the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the story mode, a free mode unlocks as you progress. You can choose character and customize game rules to engage in round after round of exciting mahjong battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fully Voiced Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 18 fully-animated adult scenes and voiced general dialogue, female characters are voiced throughout the game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196120/extras/9c13bf540d35bb72b286e2e975128838.poster.avif?t=1744958730\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196120/extras/9c13bf540d35bb72b286e2e975128838.webm?t=1744958730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196120/extras/9c13bf540d35bb72b286e2e975128838.mp4?t=1744958730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
